      <tr>
        <td style="text-align:center;font-weight:700;">5</td>
        <td><strong>Monitor temporal patterns for timing advantage.</strong> Align listing activity with seasonal demand peaks visible in the monthly trend data. Avoid listing during observable troughs when both volume and margins compress.</td>
        <td>Timing</td>
      </tr>
